<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-beane-planarian-hk-atpase-anterior-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Beane et al. (2011) planarian H,K-ATPase bioelectric V_mem anterior polarity switch — MorphoEval overall 58.8/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1 baseline assessment of `2011-beane-planarian-hk-atpase-anterior.py` (59.2/100). The initial bioelectric ODE captures bistable V_mem attractors (-65 mV and -20 mV) and basic wild-type 1H1T vs SCH-28080 0H2T switching, but requires nonlinear Bell-form voltage-gated innexin gap-junction coupling G_GJ(dV/dx) so the anterior depolarized blastema self-isolates from the hyperpolarized trunk, automated bilateral photoreceptor ocelli segmentation on `schmidtea_mediterranea_specimen.jpg`, and an explicit nifedipine L-type Ca_v channel blockade negative control alongside 8-octanol gap-junction blockade. Overall 58.8/100 (faithfulness 57.0, reproducibility 63.1); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 317bc3c; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 63, Morphological realism / specimen match 53, Parameter expressivity 58, Morphometric validation 55, Source and data traceability 66, Code-to-model traceability 61, Reproducibility package 62. Output judged: docs/media/planarian_hk_atpase_anterior_comparison.png: rendered output of 2011-beane-planarian-hk-atpase-anterior.py at 317bc3c, image/png, 586158 B, 2268×1863 px, artifact_sha256 23e52bef2eb4a12b38ececd73bb5dddfe65c95c72488302a61aea135c94575f8 (sha256 23e52bef2eb4a12b38ececd73bb5dddfe65c95c72488302a61aea135c94575f8), spec_fingerprint c0d35653d229caf892ce95227098738e04e01130c0c0eb1c24a63345a769e0d8. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: c0d35653d229caf892ce95227098738e04e01130c0c0eb1c24a63345a769e0d8; artifact_sha256: 23e52bef2eb4a12b38ececd73bb5dddfe65c95c72488302a61aea135c94575f8; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/planarian_hk_atpase_anterior/paper_citations.bib=4978cdbc97ad314e..., datasets/planarian_hk_atpase_anterior/planarian_hk_atpase_anterior_reference.json=ad7dfa156bbb79fe..., datasets/planarian_hk_atpase_anterior/schmidtea_mediterranea_specimen.jpg=466029cc05610678..., datasets/planarian_hk_atpase_anterior/scout_manifest.json=9de72183ede698f0...}." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Add automated Gaussian local-contrast ocelli (eyespot) detection and 60-bin dorsoventral width segmentation on `datasets/planarian_hk_atpase_anterior/schmidtea_mediterranea_specimen.jpg`, plus 2D body-plan contour synthesis for 1H1T, 2H0T, and 0H2T regenerates.",
        "remediation needed: Couple the bistable membrane potential PDE to nonlinear Bell-form voltage-gated gap-junction conductance G_GJ(DeltaV) = (1 - eta_oct)*G_0 / (1 + (DeltaV/V_0)^2) so anterior depolarization self-isolates from the hyperpolarized trunk.",
        "remediation needed: Include both 8-octanol gap-junction blockade (2H0T) and nifedipine L-type Ca_v channel blockade negative control (depolarized V_mem -> 0H2T) alongside a 2D (I_HK, I_IVM) phase diagram." ;
    pk:hasScore 5.88e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-beane-planarian-hk-atpase-anterior-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
